<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Eph</para>
  <para style="toc1">eljwab ela efesus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephs</para>
  <para style="toc3">EPH</para>
  <para style="mt1">eljwab ela efesus</para>
  <para style="ip">elmuqedme elγerD:eqewwi n imumnen g efesus g elimenensen s elmesiyH s ebiyyen n eTTebiyεeθ n elkeniyseθ, elbδen n elmesiyH, d elγerDes. elli yuri:emersal buwlus elli yemmeryasen:elkeniyseθ n efesus d imumnen g kul blase esbeb n tires:temmazen d tixikus bac e θqewwe tcejjeε elknayes g elbleseθdiyn. εlexaTer yemlemmeδ buwlus d lecyuwx n elkeniyseθ n efesus y exxer merre g militis(eε 20:15-17) yeqqiym elmuddeθ ptiwilt entizriyc. yessexne buwlus g enljwebes y elkeniyse n efesus eδebber n rebbi bac e yweHHeδ imexlaq n rebbi elkul g esme d elqeεεeθ, max eyaweD elweqθ, s erriYaseθ n elmesiyH. w kul ciy eySar s uδebber n rebbi d elmeciYθes. g wezyen iglewwel yHekke buwlus f elwiHdeθ, w iδukke feTTeriyqeθ elli yexθar essis rebbi ecceεbes, w max i senyeγfer leδnubensen s memmis yesuwε elmesiyH, w max i yeHfeD rebbi elweεδes emeqqar f wefus n erruwH elqudus. w g ezyen eθθani yeδεu buwlus imumnen y webriδ imqeddes ekuwnen iyδes δ imeweHen d elmesiyH belHeq. w yesθeεmel buwlus elberceθ d elkelimeθ bac e ybiyyen elweHdeθ n imumnen g elmesiyH: elkeniyseθ d elbδen w elmesiyH ixfes, welle nette elbni w elmesiyH elkurδ n esses, welle nette ettemeTTuθ w elmesiyH eryazes. w eyaweD elkateb yelqimmeθ n uεebber max eybeyyen efekker g enneεmeθ n rebbi s elmesiyH. usinc eyeδwel edwis elγne d ecceεr. w nette yzer elli kulciy s exse n elmesiyH d etteDHeyθes d weγferes d enneεmtes d weqedses.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s">etteHiyyeθ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />seg buwlus, emersal n yesuwε elmesiyH s elmeciyYeθ n rebbi, y elli δimqedsen w θemnen s yesuwε elmesiyH, (w εemren g efesus.) <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />enneεmeθ d eslam fellawem seg seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">elberxaθ n erruwH g elmesiyH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />tbark elleh erreb elli nette δ deddes n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH zade elli iberxane s kul elberxeθ n erruwH g esme. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />qebl n exlaq n eddunyeθ, yexθerane rebbi g elmesiyH bac e nkuwn δ iqeddiysen g elmesiyH usinc enebδe ndaf w δ eTTaher jar ifesnes, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />rebbi yexθerane seg qebl g elmHebθes bac e nkuwn δ idreriys seg yesuwε elmesiyH w θeδin eyendeγ elmeciYθes teSSaleHθ, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />bac e θnemdeH necxerθi f enneεmtes timmejjet elli yenεem fellane essis g memmis emeHbuwb. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />εlexaTer yesuwε elmesiyH yefδyanes iδemnes, eγfaren leδnubenne, w θahen enneεmeθ temeqqerθ elli yuceyenext, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />w elli ysuggezt fellane s eδke d elHekmeθ elli δis elkul. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />yessexnane esser n elmeciYθes teSSaleHθ elli tesserĎaθi welli yeqsetteθ s elmesiyH, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />bac rebbi eykmal elbernemajes max eδuqan luqaθ, usinc eylemmeδ elli g esme d elqeεεeθ elkul seddu elHukm n elmesiyH. <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />wegelmesiyH yexθrane erreb bac e nkuwn inette emmax i xenyqedder seg qebl. εlexaTer yeg emmax eyexs eyqerer, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />bac e nsebbeH s elmejδes nečin elli nemmen iglewlen s elmesiyH. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />w δis xenyum zade max i θeslim edwi n elHeq θemnem essis, edwi n elHeq nette ellinjiyl elli δis emneεewwem. w s elmesiyH zade yHuT rebbi ellemerθes fellawem max exenyuwc erruwH elqudus elli yuεeδ essis. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />w nette eyendeγ elεerbuwn n ewreθenne, elmeyefδe rebbi elli qbelen elweεδ. w sahen rebbi yemsebH yemmejjeδ.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">θzalliθ n buwlus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />heδake εlac max i sliγ elli xenyum ettemnem s yesuwε w texsem imumnen elkul, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />elbeTlexc seg eHmaδ n rebbi f elxĎrewwem, eδεuγawem g ezzelliθiyw. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />eDelbe seg rebbi elli nette δdeddeθna immejjed, rebbis n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH, bac e xenyuc erruwH n elHikmeθ usinc ettesnem belgde, <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />usinc eynewwer elbSiyreθ n ulewnewwem bac e θesnem elxiyr elli yeHrzewemti max yxeninabe, delberxaθ ttiγziyrin elli yedjiyneθ y leεbeδes imumnen. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />usinc eθesnem elqiymeθ n elquwweθ temeqqerθ elli yegeyenext y nečin imumnen w netteθ elquδreθ n rebbi <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />elli iHuTTiθ g elmesiyH max i θyessikker seg jar inemmutte, yesqiymi f elymines g esmaweθ <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />denni kul ejjah d eSSulTan, denni kul elquδreθ d esyaδeθ, denni kul ellesm δeyemsemme, muc kan g elweqθe wah berk yemenni g elli jeyyin zade, <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />yedj kul ciy seddu ifesnes yerri emeqqar n kul ciy g elkeniyseθ <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />elli netteθ elbeδnes. w elkeniyseθ eθkemmel elmesiyH elli nette eykemmel kul ciy.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">seg θemettent y edder</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />xenyum θkanem qebl δinemmutte s elxĎayewwem d eδnubewwem <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />elli θkanem tegguwrem δiys emmax i θegguwr eddunyeθe, ettebεem g elquwweθ n eccer elli θxeddem s leεbaδ elli εSan rebbi. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />w enkan qebl nečin elkulne m nihnin nedder g eccehweθ n elbeδnenne ntebbeε g erreγbθes, d ettexmam emuwHac, heδake εlac nkan betbiεetne δidrari n elbecer elli δexenyεaqeb rebbi m elbaqi n leεbaδ. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />yemenni erreHmeθ n rebbi θelwaseεθ d elmHebθes θemeqqerθ inečin. <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />beεεeδ inkan δinemmutte s elxĎeyenne ysedrane s elmesiyH w s enneεmeθ n rebbi eθnewlem erreHmeθ, <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />yessikrane δ yesuwε elmesiyH yesqimane iδes bac e neHkum g esmawaθ <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />usinc eyessuwfeγ enneεmtes θemeqqerθ y lejyal elli jeyyin g erreHmeθ elli yessexnenext s yesuwε elmesiyH. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />s enneεmeθ n rebbi exentuc elxlaS s eliman. w wah muc essiywem yemenni δ elhδiyyeθ seg rebbi <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />bac Hette Hed elyetteθfuxer s leεmeles. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />w sahen δ rebbi yexlqane g elqeεεeθ, yexlqane s yesuwε elmesiyH y elεmayel θeSSulleH elli iHeDrenexθent rebbi seg qebl bac e ntneθbeε.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">elweHdeθ g elmesiyH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />esfekreθ xenyum elli elleSlewwem muc δ yehuwdiyye, elli iyhudeyyen elli Hesben g imenensen δiθbab n eδehher s age n ifessen g elbδen exenHesbenc seg iθbab n δehher. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />θesfekrem elli xenyum θkanem qebl eltesinemc elmesiyH w elγerwemc elεlaqeθ iδes, θebεeδem f erreεiyyeθ n israYiyl, δ iγriyben f elεehδ n rebbi elli yuseδ s elweεδes, θedderem blac erje w la δ erreb g eddunyeθ. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />yemenni ture, g yesuwε elmesiyH teδwelem teqrebem s iδemmen n elmesiyH beεεeδ iθkanem tebεeδem. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />w elmesiyH eyendeγ eslemenne, yedje iyhuwdiyyen d elli muc iyhuwdiyyen ecceεb iyjen yheddem eSSuwr elli ykan jerasen yeεni elεδaweθ. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />yekkes s θemettentes elquwweθ ecceriyεeθ n muwse d leHkemes d elwSeyeS bac e nemmeqbel γer rebbi, yexleq elεebδ iyjen seg sentaye n eljmeεεeθ beεεeδ iyege jerasen eslam. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />usinc eySelleH jerasen d rebbi s eSSelibes, yekkes elεδaweθ yerriθ elεebδ iyjen.<verse eid="EPH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />w sahen yuseδ ibecrawem s esselm xenyum elli θkanem θebεeδem f rebbi, ibeccer zade elli kanen qreben tweliys, <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />emmale s elmesiyH nečin elkulne enged eneqreb y rebbi s erruwH icθ. <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />w seg asse xenyum meεεač δ leDyuwf w la δ iγriyben, yemenni xenyum δ iqeddiysen δ erreεiyyeθ icθ w seg iθbab n elbiyt n rebbi.<verse eid="EPH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />temmebnam f essas n imersal d lembiye, w yesuwε elmesiyH nette biyδe eθγaγet n essas, <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />w sahen essis nette elbenyeθ eθeTTef imenes usinc eθeδwel δ elheykel δ imqeddes γer rebbi. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />w essis xenyum zade elli muc δ ihuδiyyen eθeTfem beεDkum bac e θeδwlem δ elHuc y rebbi eyeεmer δiys s erruHes.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">eljwab n buwlus y elli muc δ iyhuwdiyyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />heδake εlac neč, buwlus emmeHbse felxaĎer n yesuwε elmesiyH f elxeĎrewwem, xenyum elli muc δ iyhudiyyen. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />w lazem rakum tesliym s enneεmeθ elli yuceyit rebbi f elxeĎrewwem, elxaĎer n elxeδmtewwem, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />w max i yyuwHe felle s esserres, emmax i xennuriye g ellewwel b ixtiSar. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />w iδekan teqremti ture eθesnem max etgedde efehme esser n elmesiyH, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />esserre eθyekcifc rebbi y Hette Hed qebl, emme yekcefθi ture belgde s erruHes y imerseles. d lenbyes iqeddiysen <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />essere yeqqar elli muc δ iyhudiyyen zade δ icriyxin g elwerθeθ d elbδen d elweεδ iyjen s ellinjiyl n yesuwε elmesiyH <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />elli δwele xedme δis. w θege g wahen s enneεmeθ elli yuceyit rebbi s elxeδmeθ n elquδerθes. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />reγmelli neč eyendeγ emezyan n imumnen elkul yucayiδ rebbi, enneεmeθe bac e becre elli muc δ iyhudiyyen s elγne n yesuwε elmesiyH elli liweqqic, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />usinc ebeyne y leεbaδ elkul max erreb ytδebber elbernajmes, elbernajme elli yeqqiym yemmeHrez elmuddeθ eTTitwilt g rebbi elli yexleq kul ciy. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />w sahen elHukkam d erruyyas n esmawaθ esnen lenwe elkul n elHikmeθ n rebbi elli eθban s elkeniyseθ. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />w wahen eywate eδebber diyme elli yegi rebbi g seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />elli max enemmen essis enged eneθqerreb y rebbi s eccjaεeθ. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />heδake εlac exennenne eθeysemc s elli etεaniγ δiys f elxaĎrewwem, wahen eyendeγ elmejδewwem.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">θzalliθ n buwlus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />heδake εlac eHniγ ifedniyw usinc esejδe y rebbi daddeθne <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />elli essis eθkuwn kul elεeciyreθ g esme welle g elqeεεeθ. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />emmale eDelbe essis exeniqewwe ulewnewwem s elquδreθ n erruHes felxaĎr n elγne n elmejδes, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />usinc eyeεmer elmesiyH g ulewnewwem s eliman. usinc eDelbe seg rebbi eθebθen leεruwqewwem d essisenewwem g elmHebθes. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />usinc eθeδewlem tessenem xenyum d imumnen elkul mat nette eTTuwl d elεerD d elεelw d elγerq n exse n elmesiyH, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />usinc eθesnem elli elmHebθes ekber n kul ciy usinc eθεebbem ulewnewwem s kul ciy γer rebbi. <verse eid="EPH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />rebbi elqader s elqewθes elli δiyne, eyged ayeg exθer n elli netxemmem δiys d elli eθneĎleb, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />γers elmejδ g elkeniyseθ d yesuwε elmesiyH g luqaθ d lejyal elkul. amiyn.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">eddeεweθ y elweHdeθ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />w ture eDelbe essiywem neč elli emmeHbse felxaĎer n seyyedne, eθedrem elεiyceθ eθwate eddeεweθ elli inebeyawem rebbi tweliys <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />usinc eθkuwnem δ imeθwaDεen w eHnan teSbrem teθHemlem beεDkum s exse, <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />tejθehδem bac e θHafĎem f elweHdeθ elli tusiyδ seg erruwH s esmaH d exse. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />yelle elbδen iyjen w erruwH icθ, w sahen inebeyawem rebbi bac e θemcerxem g eθmenni iyjen. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />sidyθum iyjen w elimenewwem iyjen w elmeεmudiyθewwem icθ, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />yelle erreb deddeθne iyjen yHekkem g leεbaδ elkul, eθeg s leεbaδ elkul w yeqqiym g leεbaδ elkul. <verse eid="EPH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />emme kul iyjen essiyne eyawi elbey seg enneεmeθ elli eθwate elli yqerre elmesiyH δ eθetuwac, <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />heδake εlac yenne elxθab "max i yyuwli lennej, yiwi lesre egget yuc y leεbaδ elxiyr egget". <verse eid="EPH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />w meδam yenne 'yuli' meεnahe yeggez qebl y elqeεεeθ. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />w wahen elli yeggez ennette biyδe elli yuli δenni esmawaθ bac e yεebbe kul ciy, <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />w ennette elli yuce y lebHaD bac e kuwnen δ imersal w lebHaD δ lembiye w lebHaD δimubecren w lebHaD δ essurrah w δ imuεelmen <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />bac e yHeDDer imumnen y elxeδmeθ d elbni n elbδen n elmesiyH, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />elmi naweD elkulne jemiyε g eliman iyjen d essan n memmis n rebbi. usinc eneδwel δ elbullaγ elmi naweD elkmal elli g yesuwε elmesiyH, <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />bac netqimiyc emidrari ettawi δiyne elmuwjeθ n elmδaheb eldah d eldah usinc exennawyen leεbaδ s elHiyleθ y elxsareθ. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />yemenni yelzemne enkuwn Sadqiyn g exse bac e naweD g kul ciy y elmesiyH elli nette eyendeγ iyxef, <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />elli δiys eyeTTef elbδen elkul usinc eyelSeq s elmfaSel, w max eyexδem kul iyjen elxeδemtes eyekbar elbδen, tekmel elbenyθes s exse.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">edder ejδiyd g elmesiyH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />heδake εlac eDelbe essiywem s ellesm n elmesiyH, eθeθbεemc iweθeniyen elli kefren g elbaTel, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />w nihnin s elεme n elbSirθensen d eljehlensen d teqsuwHi n ulewnensen δ iγriben f elεiyceθ n rebbi. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />w max i δwelen meεεeč etferqen jar elli ybhe elli yuwHec, sθeselmen y lenwaε elkul erδiyleθ d eTmeε w elcebεenc.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />yemenni xenyum elteθεelmemc eTTebiεeθ elmesiyH sah, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />iδekan tesliym teθεelmem eTTebiεeθ elHqiyqeθ elli g yesuwε. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />tebεδem f essirθewwem tiglewwelt tedjem elεebδ eqDiym elli fesseδnetti echawi θixeddaεin, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />eθjededem lerweHewwem d leεqulewwem, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />teδwlem m elεebδ ejδiyδ elli yexleqθi rebbi m nette g elHeq d elxiyr d exse.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />heδake εlac yelzemkum eθebεδem f θixerxas, usinc eyuθlay kul iyjen essiywem s elHeq δ iqribnes εlexaTer elkulne δ leεDe elbδen iyjen. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />w iδekan teθγececem eθeγldemc w eθedjemc eθeggez θefuθ f elγuccewwem <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />w eθedjemc emxan y ecciyĎan. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />w elli ykan iserreq yelzme eybeTTel seg esserqeθ w yelzem eyexδem s elεerq n eljbines usinc ayeg elxiyr s efuses usinc eyεawen iqelliylen. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />w eθessufγemc seg imewnewwem elkelmeθ tuHec yemenni kul elkelmeθ δ teSSaleHθ tebhe g elweqθes usinc esθfaδen essis elli esseγδan. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />w eθγececemc erruwH n rebbi εlexaTer erruwHe exθemewwem as n elfδe. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />ebεδeθ f eHqaδ d enneqmeθ d elγuc d elεerx d esubbi d lecrar elkul, <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />temsemHem terHmem beεDkum teγfrem y beεDkum emmax i yyeγfer fellawem rebbi s elli yegi elmesiyH y xenyum.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">edreθ g ennuwr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />meδemkum δ idrari elli yexsiyn rebbi, egeθ emmax yθeg nette, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />tuyuwrem g exse teyuwriθ n elmesiyH elli f elxeDrenne yDeHHe s imenes yuc imenes δ eDHiyyeθ δ temebruxθ y rebbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />yemenni ezne δ elfsaδ d eTmeε s lenweεesen elkul liθeffeγc f leεbaδ n rebbi Hette δenezγen ellesmes. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />la δ elqbaHeθ w la δ esfaheθ w la δ etfyisix wah elkul liθeffeγc fellawem, yemenni kan δ esebbeH d ecxar n rebbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />tesnem xenyum elli ezzani d elfaseδ d eĎemmaε welγres Hette elwerθ g elmelx n elmesiyH d rebbi. elli δ eδemmeε iεebbeδ g leSnam. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />weθedjemc Hette Hed exenyexδeε s edwi n elbaTel εlexater weδiyn eyγeccec rebbi f idrari n elmeεSyeθ. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />wenčerxemc. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />qebl θkanem g eθsellesθ w ture θeδwelem θefuθ s rebbi. heδake εlac yelzemkum eθuyuwrem teyuwriθ n idrari n tefuθ, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />εlexaTer eθθemreθ n elxiyr eθkuwn g elxiyr d eSlaH d elHeq. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />teθεelmem elli eyserDe rebbi, <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />w eθcerxemc g age n eccer elli eddiyc elfeyδeθ yemenni ekcfemt, <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />w elli θegenti besserqe, eneθHeccem Hette δeθnenzeγ. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />yemenni kul elli eyemmekcef eyeffeγ y θefuθ, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />w kul elli eyemsuwfeγ yeδwel ettefuθ. heδake εlac yenne elxθab: "sθaqeĎ ya elnaεes! tekreδ seg jar inemmutte, eyDewwe fellax elmesiyH" <verse eid="EPH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />terrem elbelewwem eSbiyH max eθuyuwrem muc teyuwriθ n ejjuhhal, emme teyuwriθ n elli s leεqulensen. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />elli essenen esθfaδen s elfurSeθ elli yedjeyesenteθ rebbi εlexaTer liyyam wHecneθ. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />emmale eθkunemc δ ejjuhhal tefhmem mat iyyexs rebbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />w eθeswemc ecrab εlexaTer δis decciyxaθ, yemenni εebbaθ imenewwem s erruwH elqudus, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />tuθlayem d beεDkum s edwi n esebbeH d eδkar d eHmaδ. retleθ tsebHem y rebbi seg elleγ n ulewnewwem <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />tecxrem rebbi deddaθne diyme f kul ciy, s ellesm n seyyeδne yesuwε elmesiyH.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">elwacun d iryezennesneθ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Dewεeθ beεDkum s elxuwf g rebbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />a elwacun, Deweεmeθ iryezennexmeθ emmax i tDaweεmeθ g rebbi, <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />εlexaTer eryaz nette iyxef n teθmeTTuθ emmax elmesiyH nette iyxef n elkeniyseθ, netteθ elbeδnes w nette elli yessemneεt. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />w max i tDaweε elkeniyseθ elmesiyH, eDeweεneθ elwacun iryezennesneθ g kul ciy.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />a iryazen exseθ elwecunewwem emmax i yyexse elmesiyH elkeniyseθ yDeHHe s imenes f elxeDres, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />bac e ttiqeddes yTehhert s eγessel n amen d elkelmeθ, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />w bac e ttiHeDDer y imenes δ elkeniyseθ δ timmejjet w eddis Hette elεiyb, yemenni δ timqeddesθ w eddis Hette elεiyb. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />w heδake εlac yelzem iryazen exsen elwacunensen emmax exsen elbeδnensen. w elli ayexs liweces yexse imenes. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />w eHebbe Hette iyjen eyebγeD elbeδnes, yemenni eyettelhe essis emmax i ylehhe elmesiyH s elkeniyseθ. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />εlexaTer nečin δ leĎraf n elbδen n elmesiyH. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />heδake εlac yemmeri g elxθab, "ayedj eryaz yemmes d daddes usinc eyeδwel nette d temeTTuθes elbδen iyjen." <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />esserre wah δ emeqqar w elqeSδiyw s essere, edwi elli ennixθi f elmesiyH d elkeniyseθ. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />exennenne elmerreθ xlaf. edj ayexs kul iyjen essiywem liweces emmax ayexs imenes, w edj eθqedder temeTTuθ eryazes.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">elweldin d idrarinsen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />a idrari, Dawεeθ elweldinewwem, wah eyendeγ elHeq. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />kermeθ deddeθwem d yemmeθwem w θah eyendeγ elwSaweθ tiglewwelt s elweεδ: <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />"bac e θnewleδ elxiyr usinc eTwelneθ liyyemex g elqeεεeθ". <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />w xenyum eyelweldin, eθγececemc idreriwwem yemenni rebbemten emmax i xeniweSSe rebbi.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">lesyad d ixδiymen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />a ixδiymen Dewεeθ lesyeδewwem s elxuwf d errehbeθ d uwl δ undif emmax i tDewaεem g elmesiyH, <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />muc m wiyn yexs eyserDe leεbaδ, yemenni txedmem y rebbi, <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />w edj eθkuwn elxeδmtewwem y nihnin enniyyeθ etteSafiθ tgulec εliykum θxedmem y rabbi w muc y leεbaδ, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />w esneθ elli rebbi yetjaze kul iyjen eyexδem elxeδmeθ δ teSSaleHθ δ exδiym uneγ δ Hurri. <verse eid="EPH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />w xenyum zade a lesyad, εamleθ ixδimnewwem belgde, entheδeδemc tesnem elli siδinsen d siδiθwem g esme nette iyjen w elyetjamil Hed.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">eslaH n rebbi elkamel y ejaheδ n erruwH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />w gellexxer exennenne θqewwaθ g rebbi d elquδerθes θemeqqarθ. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />tewyem eslaH n rebbi elkamel bac e θqewmem elHiylaθ n ecciyĎan, <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />εlexaTer nečin netHeribc g elεδu s exsum d iδemmen yemenni g iθbab n essulTaθ d erriyaseθ g elεalem, elεalem elli elkulle δ θsellesθ d lerwaH n eccer esseylelneθ g esme. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />heδake εlac yelzemkum eθqamem eslaH n rebbi bac e θgeddem eθqewmem as n eccer w eltuciym eθgeddem eθHerbem beεδ eθegem kul ciy belgde. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />θebθeθ imenewwem tegem elHeq m elHzem g emmesewwem, w elεeδl m edderε f elbeδnewwem, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />θeTfem eSHiH g encar n elbcareθ n esselm m eSSebbaĎ g ikreεnewwem. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />eθεebbem ulewnewwem s eliman elmeδuwlen m etturs eθesbeddem essis esehm elεefyeθ n eccer. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />tegem emneε m elkeskeθ y iyxef, w elkelmeθ n rebbi m essiyf n erruwH. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />ezzelleθ g erruwH luqaθ elkul, terrem elbelewwem, eθwaDbem f eδεe y imumnen elkul. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />teδεumiδ y neč zade bac e yweffeq rebbi g ebeccer n ellinjiyl s ecjaεeθ <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />elli neč δ essefires elli yemmeqqen s eslasel. eδεuwmiδ bac e nabiγ essis s ecjaεeθ emmax yelzem age.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">etHaye θigluxrin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />emme leHweliyw d leεmeliyw ture exenixebber fellasen yeweθne emeHbuwb yewwe tiyxiykus w nette imuεewniyw g elxeδmeθ n rebbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />uzenγewemti beδδemme bac e xenixebber f leHwelenne usinc eySebber ulewnewem. <verse eid="EPH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />eslam f ewmeθnenne elkul d eliman d exse seg rebbi deddaθne d seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />elneεmeθ eθkuwn f elli exsen seyysdne yesuwε elkul w exsenti exse etmettic.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>